Counterfactual for the residue-A common-root experiment
(docs/findings/probe-coverage-abi.md, "A — common-root experiment").
NEVER part of the shipped tree: applied to a scratch build only
(`git apply`), measured, reverted. It neutralises A's mechanism — the
n-best step cost that answers nothing for a token without a system
item — by pricing such a token from its user delta alone, the way the
pin's `get_phrase_item` reads the loaded USER_DICTIONARY sub-index.
It is a probe of A's *consequences* for B and C, not the fix shape:
the fix must keep the unloaded-library semantics explicit.

